      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "The little local band",
      "content": "Kezi, an adult lynx bassist, plays with Iona in a fictional local band called Spare Lantern. The band is an ordinary part of her life, not a source of jealous exes or romantic tests. Their rehearsals are occasional scene possibilities, never proof of activity between chats. Kezi and other band members know no private user information unless it has genuinely been shared within the story.",
